<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95782" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπαρτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ός</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Supp.</u>
			578
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπείρω</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sown, grown from seed,
			cultivated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				6.8.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.37
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of men, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ . . σπαρτοί τε καὶ αὐτόχθονες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					247c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπαρτῶν γένος</span> children
				<i>of men</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				410
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> esp. at
			Thebes, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σπαρτοί, οἱ</span>, <i>the Sown-men</i>, those who sprang from
			the dragon's teeth <i>sown</i> by Cadmus, and their descendants,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				1.30
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				7(6).10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σπαρτῶν στάχυς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐχίων σπαρτός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.1285
				</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				 ii 9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1292 i 3
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				1274
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγχη σπαρτός</span> the
				<u>Theban</u> spear, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				578
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>scattered</i>, of the limbs of a corpse, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.383
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
